 white;\">\n                            <h2 id=\"day6-title\" style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600;\">Gardens & Reflection</h2>\n                            <p style=\"margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0; opacity: 0.9;\">Peaceful Conclusion</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\">\n                            <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; color: #ff9ff3; font-size: 1.1rem;\">Morning: Imperial East Gardens</h3>\n                            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.4; color: #666;\">Meditative walk through meticulously designed landscapes, understand Japanese garden philosophy and seasonal appreciation.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; color: #ff9ff3; font-size: 1.1rem;\">Afternoon: Cultural Reflection</h3>\n                            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.4; color: #666;\">Visit a local community center, participate in cultural exchange, and reflect on your journey through Tokyo's rich heritage.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer style=\"text-align: center; padding: 2rem 1rem; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); margin-top: 2rem;\">\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); font-size: 0.9rem;\">Immerse yourself in the rich cultural tapestry of Tokyo</p>\n    </footer>\n\n    <style>\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            main > div > div:first-child {\n                display: none !important;\n            }\n            \n            main > div > div:last-child {\n                flex-direction: column !important;\n                align-items: center;\n            }\n            